### List seeded vehicles
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vehicles

### Create an order for the first vehicle (change ID if necessary)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerName":"Vasa","customerEmail":"demo@example.com","vehicleId":1}

### Simulate a declined payment (order stays PENDING)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":1,"approved":false}

### Simulate successful payment (car becomes SOLD)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":1,"approved":true}

### Check vehicle status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vehicles/1

### Check order status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1

### Check payment attempts for order
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payments/order/1
